TODAY'S TARGETS: ${T.kcal} kcal, protein ${T.p} g, fibre ${T.fib} g, carbs ${T.c} g, fat ${T.f} g.${T.ex?` Includes ${r0(T.ex*P.eatBack/100)} kcal added back from training.`:''}
EATEN SO FAR: ${fmt(t.kcal)} kcal, protein ${r0(t.p)} g, fibre ${r0(t.fib)} g, carbs ${r0(t.c)} g, fat ${r0(t.f)} g.
${eaten}
TRAINING TODAY: ${ex}
REMAINING: ${fmt(left.kcal)} kcal, protein ${r0(left.p)} g, fibre ${r0(left.fib)} g, carbs ${r0(left.c)} g, fat ${r0(left.f)} g.`;
